{
  "description": "A call that crashed between its pre-input marker and its reply is never delivered again. The case plants that crash state in its fresh runtime dir: the pre-input marker of callId k-crash with no receipt. Every re-drive of k-crash, in one engine and after a restart, answers TransactionFailed{recovery_required, callId} with disposition delivery_uncertain/unsafe and sends nothing; another callId in the scope is delivered; k-crash stays refused after it.",
  "supersedes": [
    "v3-marker-crash-redrive-uncertain.json"
  ],
  "transport": "stdio",
  "scenario": "crates/omo-computer-backend-fake/fixtures/v3-two-displays-one-window-consent.json",
  "env": {
    "OMO_COMPUTER_FAKE_STOP_PATH": "live"
  },
